  "description": "Livingston Robotics Club (LRC) is a robotics club in Livingston, New Jersey, US, that provides a community network to introduce Livingston area youth to robotics design and real-life science research, consistent with the concept of FIRST (For Inspiration and Recognition of Science and Technology). LRC member teams have won state, national, and international FIRST LEGO League (FLL) competitions.",
